pater    -> faþer
treyes   -> þreyes
kerd     -> hert, feeding order gives herþ
dekm     -> tehm, feeding order gives þehm
bhrater  -> braþer, feeding order gives fraþer
genu     -> kenu, feeding order gives henu
yugom    -> yukom, feeding order gives yuhom
dhur     -> dur, feeding order gives þur
pod      -> fot, feeding order gives foþ
ghans    -> gans, feeding order gives hans
8 of 10 words depend on the rule order
